                "kind" : "Outlet",
                "name" : "3D Landmarks",
                "portDescription" : "All 468 FaceMesh landmarks (same order as Landmarks) as the canonical face model fit to this frame, placed in Fabric's scene space so the default perspective camera sees it on top of the image: it keeps its metric size and only its position is fit to the image landmarks, so a face that appears larger sits nearer the camera (larger z); a face 1 m away sits on the image plane. A true 3D shape, so x\/y match Landmarks only approximately. Directly comparable against MediaPipe Hand\/Pose Landmarks' own 3D Landmarks output, so all three can be composited in one 3D scene — not physically metric, just a consistent shared space. Empty if nothing was detected."
